  "review_notes": [
    "Independently reviewed the current top-level proposal.json in full (186 lines), functionality.md in full (37 lines), fact-dispositions.json in full (384 lines), and link-dispositions.json in full (232 lines). The reviewed proposal is the exact input SHA, not the earlier librarian proposal embedded in context.",
    "Read both owned files completely in canonical and rendered form, all 14 subject records and all 11 outgoing baseline links. All seven proposed writes address owned subjects and are supported. No replacement proposal, new links, entities, merges or mutations are supplied.",
    "Canonical foreign definitions confirm the principal corrections: ftKb_SpecialN_800F1F1C requests an effect only for Kirby; spawn kind 2 selects a by-value vector copy; ft_80082D40 ignores its second argument and performs active collision processing; ftCheckThrowB3 clears B3 on success.",
    "Entry position snapshots follow Fighter_ChangeMotionState. Collision processing can replace the intermediate position and invoke a landing response before the final Y/Z self-velocity clearing. True from ftCo_8009EF68 indicates entry-path invocation, not guaranteed final StopCeil residence.",
    "The active motion-state table registers all four callbacks. The external ft_800835B0 consumer tries accepted contact, wall jump and ledge handling before the ceiling gate. Rendered Check/Enter and external landing/predicate aliases were not used as independent evidence.",
    "Boundary review confirms mask-zero versus nonzero behavior, line-ID -1 rejection, platform acceptance only on a strict stick-Y comparison, strict landing velocity comparison, signed-zero and unordered-comparison branches, short-circuit B3 consumption, and absence of local finite-value validation in entry arithmetic.",
    "The effect API copies the stack vector and retains the joint pointer. The collision wrapper/dispatcher invokes its response synchronously without storing that response. Deeper predicate retention, joint teardown and runtime object-lifetime guarantees remain deferred.",
    "Acceptance includes the explicit unresolved dispositions below. It does not promote section-layout claims, final ceiling placement, global stationarity, global non-actionability, effect visuals or guaranteed eventual Fall to established facts."
  ],
